  "privacyTitle": "Privacy Notice",
  "privacyHeadline": "Your data stays on your device",
  "privacyBody": "MoviRehab works without an account and offline: it does not send information to any server.",
  "privacyLocalTitle": "Local processing",
  "privacyLocalBody": "All the information is stored in a SQLite database inside the private storage of the app. MoviRehab needs no sign-up, uses no servers of its own or from third parties and includes no advertising, analytics or trackers.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "What data is stored",
  "privacyDataBody": "• The names of the users you create in the app.\n• Your own exercises (name, joint and range in degrees).\n• Sessions: date and, for each measurement, the exercise, the maximum angle reached and the repetitions.\n• Your preferences: theme, language and active user.\n\nNo email, phone number, location, photos, video or audio is requested or stored.",
  "privacyUseTitle": "What it is used for",
  "privacyUseBody": "Only to show you your progress: statistics, activity calendar, history and the summary of each session. The data of each user is kept separate and is not combined or used for any other purpose.",
  "privacySensorsTitle": "Sensors and permissions",
  "privacySensorsBody": "The automatic repetition count uses the accelerometer of the phone. Its readings are processed on the spot, only while the measurement is active, and are not stored: only the maximum angle and the number of repetitions are saved when you tap Save measurement. The accelerometer needs no permission.\n\nThe app declares the camera and microphone permissions for future features, but the current version does not capture images or sound. You can review their status in Settings.",
  "privacySharingTitle": "Sharing information",
  "privacySharingBody": "MoviRehab does not share data on its own. The Share button of the summary only copies a text to the clipboard when you tap it; you decide where to paste it.",
  "privacyControlTitle": "Your control over your data",
  "privacyControlBody": "• You can rename or delete a user from Profile and users: their sessions and measurements are deleted too.\n• Your own exercises can be deleted from their detail screen.\n• Clearing the app data in the system settings, or uninstalling the app, removes all the information.\n• If your device has system backups enabled, it is the system that decides whether the app data is included.",
  "privacyHealthTitle": "Health notice",
  "privacyHealthBody": "MoviRehab is an exercise support tool and is not a medical device. The measurements of the phone sensor are approximate (they only detect changes of tilt). Always follow the instructions of your physiotherapist or doctor and stop the exercise if you feel pain.",
  "privacyUpdated": "Notice version 2.0 · November 2026",
